## Module 3 — Conda Environments

### Check existing environments

```bash
conda env list
```

### Create a clean environment

```bash
conda create -n learning_env python=3.12 -y
```

Wait for:

```text
Executing transaction: done
```

### Activate it

```bash
conda activate learning_env
```

Expected:

```bash
(learning_env) C:\Users\YourName>        # Windows
(learning_env) YourName@MacBook ~ %      # macOS
```

Verify Python:

```bash
python --version
```

Expected: `Python 3.12.x`

**Checkpoint:** Prompt shows `(learning_env)`, not `(base)`.

